{{Term/Store|Armored Carp|Armored Carp|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Biography==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Armored Carp}}
Armored Carp are a type of [[Fish]] found in bodies of freshwater throughout [[Hyrule]]. Large deposits of calcium within their scales cause them to be as hard as armor. Because of this, [[Cooking]] them into a [[Meal]] will grant the consumer [[Defense Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Once caught, they can be eaten raw to heal one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Alternatively, they can be exposed to [[Fire]] to turn into [[Roasted Carp]] or frozen into [[Frozen Carp]].

